{"title":"1992 OIM Problems/Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_OIM_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/b/0/cb07e848f9188a9fd706d99ab6513a7d949c48a1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a_n)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"35\" height=\"20\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/b/3bbc540ba557955e58c4e6099651014d129f2c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(b_n)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"29\" height=\"18\" /> be two sequences of integers that verify the following conditions:\n</p><p>i. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/7/037e06aff5ed7a98863dd6d0512a53071efeca49.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_0 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"52\" height=\"17\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/0/350b8681c8eaf84046f5b43a37cac90773154aa6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b_0 = 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"50\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p>ii. For all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/1/821d5b948fd2e8a82be18042d192710914b5e819.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n \\geq 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"43\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/7/9b7c2c8641ff445fd1ed25d9557bb47c0a762021.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_{n+2}=2a_{n+1}-a_{n}+2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"178\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/9/7/297f72c235fc1618131994e877c490a61aa173e1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b_{n+2}=2b_{n+1}-b_{n}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"142\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>iii. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/4/b444575c3e52bed8f22c2ef58a9a00deb114bad5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_{n}^{2}+b_{n}^{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"60\" height=\"21\" /> is a perfect square for all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/2/3/9238d82d59d5dfe79e96d916bfdf2f4acc4ed3be.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n\\ge 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"43\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p>Find at least two values of pair <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/4/614ff7a625a97fcde5e68ff25d50ae5c56de293b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a_{1992},b_{1992})$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"96\" height=\"20\" />.\n</p><p><br />\n~translated into English by Tomas Diaz. ~orders@tomasdiaz.com\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_OIM_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>First we find the non-recursive form of this with unknown <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/b/1ab39d761413804680d26d972381f028001562f5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"19\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/f/69fc4b9ed6d75d026557e7b06c2ed483c6ed0eda.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" />:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/e/87e296e6c8341f17ff300dbfdb7c906e1e33977f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_n=na_1+n(n+1))$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"169\" height=\"20\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/4/2545ebb9b38f6598763e590ea151094c9fc7797c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b_n=nb_1-8(n-1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"157\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/5/82588628661d1f9d2a76d3b8935423301062578d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A=a_1-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"88\" height=\"17\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/d/48d5b3d9cf781a9b6bc618fe52bea5547148d48e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B=b_1-8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"87\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/b/7/db74c465703ad05c36deef875351c5e70309e14e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_n=n^2+An$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"110\" height=\"20\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/8/d18df3fa49b844ae4b50d2c1a02cdc922c1b6f7a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b_n=Bn+8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"100\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/8/9/a894f445350a2fdcbc3ea14616b2ee1745611ea3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_n^2+b_n^2=(n^2+An)^2+(Bn+8)^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"271\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/7/837476f9d675df1acca68be4aeaedb15c8eb1dc5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_n^2+b_n^2=n^4+2An^3+(A^2+B^2)n^2+16Bn+8^2=S^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"434\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/6/a963c5234760870aab1ed1f7e929273b6f8a2e40.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S^2=(n^2+Kn+8)^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"167\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/e/69e122502750b1a29afde3eb1c7be1d1ab58fbc2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S^2=n^4+2Kn^3+(16+K^2)n^2+16Kn+8^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"357\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p>From the coefficient in front of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/a/4ba37f50c674bcbae995ed1d9dfd4beb5e53c765.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n^3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"17\" /> we find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/d/9/3d9b63126c3fce9ca49ba9afec0a137c8cbf7a3b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2K=2A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"75\" height=\"14\" /> thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/c/c/3cc16a5fbc3cdcd9ed7ac42ac7362e7a804f5dad.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A=K$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p>From the coefficient in front of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> we find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/3/8/1389f043187a36c3f8267f1a1a41af37445c95f2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$16K=16B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"94\" height=\"14\" /> thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/0/e700a7d3904a5cc6de9fa5c080e78ca16c54bafa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B=K$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"58\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/3/663b2ed89371c65416e8697ca6aaff9238127643.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A=B=K$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"95\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p>From the coefficient in front of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/0/6006bba637eef443381fbaff768fa62d9ff41e62.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"17\" /> we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/c/0dcdf6dda4aaafbf5e9e861c2c1e87c10eca9c32.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(16+K^2)=(A^2+B^2)=(K^2+K^2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"293\" height=\"21\" /> therefore <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/9/8393f6f1a500750531b1715cfd494eb369f8f11c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$K^2=16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"68\" height=\"17\" />, thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/8/358b5f5b82a1b78475df6bebaa6b362a40804833.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$K= \\pm 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"66\" height=\"16\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/b/40b61e3654015de57ef7849a2da7e0cc6cdd8ac5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A=B=\\pm 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"102\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p>Substituting we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/1/15169b079b7541eac94509b877de47ff2b280da7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_n=n^2\\pm 4n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"105\" height=\"20\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/c/99c1be4f66d4eaf8e032ac72f814ebca8b896365.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b_n=\\pm 4n+8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"108\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p>Thus \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/c/d9c4805aff3fd8479944d3ce2fe5e75c3f2a435b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a_{1992},b_{1992})=(1992^2 + 4\\cdot 1992,4\\cdot 1992+8)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"357\" height=\"21\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/a/0aa33a68ea981311ea461720ebe3800bc3869e32.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1992^2 - 4\\cdot 1992,-4\\cdot 1992+8)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"253\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/1/771ecac1eb62ce6689459f2fc48cb6f636ecae1b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a_{1992},b_{1992})=(3976032,7976)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"243\" height=\"20\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/8/d/88dd296cd0c311be2c2e71ca3b2d9842f4ee1951.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(3960096,-7960)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"138\" height=\"20\" />\n</p>\n<ul><li>Note.  I actually competed at this event in Venezuela when I was in High School representing Puerto Rico.  I think I got like 2 or 3 points out of 10 on this one.  I don't remember what I did.</li></ul>\n<p>~Tomas Diaz. ~orders@tomasdiaz.com\n</p><p><br />\n<i>Alternate solutions are always welcome. If you have a different, elegant solution to this problem, please <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=1992_OIM_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit\">add it</a> to this page.</i>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_OIM_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=OIM_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"OIM Problems and Solutions\">OIM Problems and Solutions</a>\n</p><p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.oma.org.ar/enunciados/ibe7.htm\">https://www.oma.org.ar/enunciados/ibe7.htm</a>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017183448\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.022 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.035 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 215/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 344/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 7385/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    5.259      1 Template:Alternate_solutions\n100.00%    5.259      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:26078:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017183448 and revision id 208216. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}